  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf7",
      "name": "📋 WF7 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -224,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF7 — Appointment Reminders\n\nRuns every 30 minutes. Reads Appointment Log + Clients.\nSends SMS reminders to clients with upcoming appointments.\n\n**Reminder sequence:**\n- R1: 24h before (22–26h window) — day-before reminder\n- R2: 2h before (1–3h window) — same-day reminder\n\n**Duplicate protection:** Reminder1Sent / Reminder2Sent stamps\n**SMS opt-out:** Cross-referenced from Clients tab\n**Failure isolation:** Split in Batches(1) — one failed SMS never kills others\n**Error alert:** Failed sends notify owner via SMS\n\n**New Appointment Log columns required:**\nAppointmentTimeISO | Reminder1Sent | Reminder2Sent | ConfirmedAt | CancelledAt\n\n**CONFIRM/CANCEL replies:** Handled by WF6 (new intent branches)\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2 + Twilio",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf7-logic",
      "name": "📋 Reminder Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reminder Window Logic\n\n**R1 (24h):** diffH >= 22 && diffH <= 26\n→ 4h window catches any 30-min cron run near the 24h mark\n\n**R2 (2h):** diffH >= 1 && diffH <= 3\n→ 2h window catches any cron run near the 2h mark\n\n**Skip conditions:**\n- Appointment Log Status !== 'confirmed'\n- CancelledAt is set (client cancelled via SMS)\n- Clients.SMS Opt-Out === 'Y'\n- AppointmentTimeISO missing or unparseable\n- Appointment already in the past (diffH < 0)\n- Reminder already sent (Reminder1Sent / Reminder2Sent not empty)\n\n**Error handling:** Failed Twilio sends alert owner via SMS",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
